## Remaining Work — Grouped by Category

### 🔴 A. Backend Hardening (from Senior Dev Review)

These are critical gaps the `senior-dev-review.md` identified:

| Item | Status | File |
|------|--------|------|
| Check-in GETDEL atomic nonce burn | ⚠️ Verify it uses `GETDEL` not GET→DEL | `attendance.service.ts` |
| Rate limiting on check-in (3/min/user) | ❌ Missing | `attendance.service.ts` |
| deviceId enforcement on check-in | ❌ Missing | `attendance.service.ts` |
| Production `/health` (DB+Redis check) | ❌ Returns `{ status: 'ok' }` only | `app.ts` or `health.routes.ts` |
| Pagination on attendance logs | ❌ Missing | `admin.routes.ts` |
| Redis caching for hot paths (active trip, route assignment) | ⚠️ Partial | `attendance.service.ts` |
| Structured JSON logging on check-in | ❌ Missing | `attendance.service.ts` |

### 🔴 B. Backend Background Jobs

| Job | Status | Planned File |
|-----|--------|-------------|
| Nightly trip pre-creation (11pm) | ❌ Missing | `jobs/create-daily-trips.job.ts` |
| Mark absent on trip end | ❌ Missing | `jobs/mark-absent.job.ts` |
| GPS heartbeat check (60s) | ❌ Missing | `jobs/gps-heartbeat.job.ts` |
| GPS retention cleanup (nightly) | ❌ Missing | `jobs/gps-cleanup.job.ts` |
| Late start alert (10min) | ❌ Missing | `jobs/late-start-alert.job.ts` |
| Arrival push fallback (2min gate) | ❌ Missing | `jobs/arrival-push-fallback.job.ts` |

> Only `jobs.routes.ts` exists currently (for auth provisioning). The 6 core background jobs above are **not yet implemented**.

