## Priority Order for Remaining Work

1. **Backend jobs** — Nightly trip creation, absent marking, GPS heartbeat (system doesn't work without these)
2. **Arrival verification** — Backend endpoint + mobile deep link screen
3. **Check-in hardening** — GETDEL verify, rate limit, deviceId, structured logging
4. **Mobile verification** — Confirm QR scanner, offline queue, kiosk refresh work end-to-end
5. **Production health endpoint**
6. **CI/CD pipeline** — GitHub Actions deploy to Cloud Run
7. **Full E2E test** — The 25th build step
